  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "43340784",
      "title": "Providing User Feedback with The useFormStatus Hook",
      "lectureOrder": 170,
      "videoOrder": 158,
      "sourceHash": "04858997683e64119474f0c47060c83cf4d1dc113818030cb6ed3125689d1323",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.57,
          "end": 2.85,
          "en": "So how can we make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.85,
          "end": 5.22,
          "en": "that we give the user some feedback",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.22,
          "end": 6.78,
          "en": "that the form is being submitted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 6.78,
          "end": 8.46,
          "en": "and that we then redirect the user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 8.46,
          "end": 11.07,
          "en": "once the form submission has been done?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 11.07,
          "end": 12.99,
          "en": "Well, I'll start with redirecting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 12.99,
          "end": 16.8,
          "en": "because that's the easier or quicker part.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 16.8,
          "end": 19.77,
          "en": "And for that we have to do two things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 19.77,
          "end": 21.03,
          "en": "As a first step,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 21.03,
          "end": 25.334,
          "en": "we should await this store post operation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 25.334,
          "end": 30,
          "en": "because in that store post function, I added a delay",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30,
          "end": 32.34,
          "en": "to simulate a slow server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.34,
          "end": 34.937,
          "en": "and therefore this store post function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 34.937,
          "end": 36.93,
          "en": "returns a promise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 36.93,
          "end": 40.773,
          "en": "which only resolves after one second in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.67,
          "end": 44.31,
          "en": "Therefore, I have to await this operation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.31,
          "end": 46.5,
          "en": "And then thereafter, I wanna redirect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 46.5,
          "end": 50.16,
          "en": "and we can redirect with help of the redirect function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 50.16,
          "end": 52.56,
          "en": "which is imported from the next navigation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.56,
          "end": 54.39,
          "en": "package like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 54.39,
          "end": 57.03,
          "en": "And make sure that you are importing it from there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 57.03,
          "end": 58.863,
          "en": "and not from anywhere else.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 59.7,
          "end": 62.37,
          "en": "This redirect function can then be called",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 62.37,
          "end": 65.61,
          "en": "to redirect the user to some other page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 65.61,
          "end": 67.71,
          "en": "and you could call that directly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 67.71,
          "end": 71.34,
          "en": "from inside some component function as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 71.34,
          "end": 75.99,
          "en": "But here we're calling it from inside that server action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 75.99,
          "end": 80.46000000000001,
          "en": "Redirect then simply takes a string that defines the path",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 80.46000000000001,
          "end": 82.53,
          "en": "to which you wanna redirect, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 82.53,
          "end": 84.453,
          "en": "to the /feed route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 85.62,
          "end": 87.674,
          "en": "So that's the first step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 87.674,
          "end": 91.26,
          "en": "The second step now is that I actually want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 91.26,
          "end": 93.174,
          "en": "to replace these buttons here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 93.174,
          "end": 96.37700000000001,
          "en": "with some loading text whilst we're handling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 96.37700000000001,
          "end": 99.72,
          "en": "the form submission on the server site.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 99.72,
          "end": 102.989,
          "en": "And to do that, we can use another hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 102.989,
          "end": 105.6,
          "en": "provided by React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 105.6,
          "end": 107.52000000000001,
          "en": "And yes, it's again, a hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 107.52000000000001,
          "end": 110.67,
          "en": "provided by React, not NextJS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 110.67,
          "end": 112.799,
          "en": "Specifically, it's a hook provided",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 112.799,
          "end": 116.34,
          "en": "by the React dom package actually,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 116.34,
          "end": 118.62299999999999,
          "en": "the use form status hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 119.816,
          "end": 122.319,
          "en": "Now to use this hook, we need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 122.319,
          "end": 127.319,
          "en": "to create a separate component function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 127.482,
          "end": 131.16,
          "en": "and I'll actually create that in a separate file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 131.16,
          "end": 135.06,
          "en": "because it will need to become a client component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 135.06,
          "end": 138.18,
          "en": "And I don't wanna turn this overall component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 138.18,
          "end": 139.713,
          "en": "into a client component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 140.61,
          "end": 143.67000000000002,
          "en": "So I'll actually add a new component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 143.67000000000002,
          "end": 144.87,
          "en": "in the Components folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 144.87,
          "end": 148.803,
          "en": "And I'll name it form-submit.js,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 149.67000000000002,
          "end": 151.56,
          "en": "or that's the file name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 151.56,
          "end": 155.643,
          "en": "I'll name the component form, submit though like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 156.93,
          "end": 159.36,
          "en": "And then in there, I want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 159.36,
          "end": 162.42000000000002,
          "en": "to use this use form status hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 162.42000000000002,
          "end": 166.29,
          "en": "So you should import use form status",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 166.29,
          "end": 170.853,
          "en": "from React-dom, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 172.028,
          "end": 174.96,
          "en": "And then call this hook here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 174.96,
          "end": 177.663,
          "en": "in the form submit component function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 178.65,
          "end": 182.07,
          "en": "And this hook will give you a status object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 182.07,
          "end": 185.295,
          "en": "that contains various information about the submission",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 185.295,
          "end": 189.48,
          "en": "status of a surrounding form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 189.48,
          "end": 193.86,
          "en": "So this component which uses this hook, must now be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 193.86,
          "end": 195.48,
          "en": "inside of a form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 195.48,
          "end": 198.78,
          "en": "So between those form element tag.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 198.78,
          "end": 199.77,
          "en": "That's required",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 199.77,
          "end": 201.123,
          "en": "for this hook to work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 201.96,
          "end": 205.95,
          "en": "Then here I'll simply return these buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 205.95,
          "end": 209.31,
          "en": "So I'll grab these two buttons here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 209.31,
          "end": 213.69299999999998,
          "en": "and cut them from the new post page component here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 214.53,
          "end": 218.07,
          "en": "And instead return them here wrapped with a fragment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 218.07,
          "end": 220.503,
          "en": "since we have two sibling elements here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 222.03,
          "end": 223.38,
          "en": "And now we can",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 223.38,
          "end": 227.716,
          "en": "and should use this newly added form submit component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 227.716,
          "end": 230.1,
          "en": "instead of these buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 230.1,
          "end": 231.32999999999998,
          "en": "And as mentioned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 231.32999999999998,
          "end": 235.29,
          "en": "this component, since it uses this use form status hook,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 235.29,
          "end": 239.31,
          "en": "must be used between form tax that's required,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 239.31,
          "end": 241.32,
          "en": "which is the case here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 241.32,
          "end": 243.39,
          "en": "Now with that though, you would get an error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 243.39,
          "end": 244.86,
          "en": "because as I mentioned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 244.86,
          "end": 248.7,
          "en": "this use form status hook can now only be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 248.7,
          "end": 250.77,
          "en": "in a client component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 250.77,
          "end": 251.97,
          "en": "So in a component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 251.97,
          "end": 256.067,
          "en": "that has this use client directive at the top of the file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 256.067,
          "end": 259.83,
          "en": "Therefore we should go to this forum submit component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 259.83,
          "end": 261.963,
          "en": "and add use client here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 263.037,
          "end": 266.916,
          "en": "And with that, the error will go away.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 266.916,
          "end": 268.71,
          "en": "Now, that's not all though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 268.71,
          "end": 270.99,
          "en": "because at the moment we're not using this hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 270.99,
          "end": 274.77,
          "en": "and this status, but that's what I'll do next,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 274.77,
          "end": 278.61,
          "en": "because this status object will actually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 278.61,
          "end": 281.25,
          "en": "have a pending prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 281.25,
          "end": 284.55,
          "en": "and you can cons lock the entire object to find out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 284.55,
          "end": 286.332,
          "en": "what else is in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 286.332,
          "end": 289.688,
          "en": "But most importantly, it has this pending property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 289.688,
          "end": 292.252,
          "en": "which is a Boolean, so true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 292.252,
          "end": 295.895,
          "en": "or false, which tells us if the surrounding form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 295.895,
          "end": 298.53,
          "en": "is currently being submitted,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 298.53,
          "end": 302.46,
          "en": "and if the surrounding form is being submitted and pending,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 302.46,
          "end": 305.71,
          "en": "therefore is true, I wanna return a paragraph here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 305.71,
          "end": 309.253,
          "en": "where I say creating posts like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 309.253,
          "end": 312.06,
          "en": "and otherwise if it's not pending,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 312.06,
          "end": 313.773,
          "en": "I'll return those buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 314.789,
          "end": 318,
          "en": "And with that, if we now save that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 318,
          "end": 322.067,
          "en": "and reload, we got those buttons here initially,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 322.067,
          "end": 326.61,
          "en": "but now if I, again, enter some data, pick some image,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 326.61,
          "end": 330.39,
          "en": "and click Create Post, you see I got this fallback text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 330.39,
          "end": 333.06,
          "en": "and then we are redirected to the feed page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 333.06,
          "end": 336.93,
          "en": "So both features work: the redirection",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 336.93,
          "end": 341.1,
          "en": "and the fallback content we're showing here instead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 341.1,
          "end": 344.4,
          "en": "of the buttons, whilst the form is being submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 344.4,
          "end": 347.1,
          "en": "And as you see, this feature can easily be added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 347.1,
          "end": 349.11,
          "en": "with the use form status hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 349.11,
          "end": 350.55,
          "en": "The only important thing here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 350.55,
          "end": 353.7,
          "en": "is that it must be in a separate component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 353.7,
          "end": 355.389,
          "en": "which then must be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 355.389,
          "end": 358.44,
          "en": "between form elements that's required,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 358.44,
          "end": 362.673,
          "en": "and that separate component must be a client component.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
